# Arguments used by the real BiSheng compiler to lower a .ttadapter input to
# the CVPipelining boundary. Keep one complete command-line argument per line.
#
# The capture-only MLIR flags (--mlir-print-ir-*) are intentionally not stored
# here: they do not configure the compilation pipeline and are added by
# dump_before_cvpipelining_dataset.py.
--enable-hfusion-compile
--enable-hivm-compile
--enable-triton-kernel-compile
--enable-memory-display
--mlir-disable-threading
